title: The Strike Call
subtitle: Central Germany is out. The rest of the country is at work.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_march = 1 and crisis_time = 1
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
on-arrival: {!
// 23 March: the unemployed occupy the Hamburg yards and are shot out of them
RG.district('hamburg', {militancy: 10, repression: 10});
Q.e21_ma_called = 0;
Q.e21_ma_gain = 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

= The Strike Call

On 23 March the unemployed of Hamburg occupy the Vulcan and Blohm und Voss yards, and the police clear them with rifle fire. Everywhere else outside Central Germany the factories are working.

[? if e21_march_mode = 2 : Max Hoelz has come from the Vogtland with his bands. They hold villages for a day, rob banks to pay the fighters and blow up rail lines. ?][? if e21_march_mode = 1 : The strike is solid in the copper district and in the chemical works. ?] The Zentrale must decide how far to widen it.

- @national: Call a general strike across the Reich.
- @regional: Keep the strike to Central Germany.
- @appeal: Ask the SPD and USPD workers to come out with us.

@national
subtitle: Everything depends on whether the workers answer. Where they do not, our men will try to make them.
on-arrival: {!
var gain = (Q.worker_support >= 30) ? 120 : ((Q.worker_support >= 20) ? 80 : 50);
Q.e21_ma_called = 1;
Q.e21_ma_gain = gain;
if (Q.worker_support < 25) { Q.e21_ma_rift += 2; }
var need = (gain >= 120) ? 45 : ((gain >= 80) ? 55 : 68);
var names = [];
for (var d of ['berlin', 'ruhr', 'hamburg', 'saxony', 'thuringia', 'bremen']) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_militancy'] >= need) {
        if (RG.startStrike(d, true)) { gain += 15; names.push(RG.dname(d)); }
    }
}
Q.e21_ma_strikes = names.length;
Q.e21_ma_struck_names = names.join(', ');
Q.e21_ma_out += gain;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

The call goes out on 24 March. [? if e21_ma_gain >= 120 : Hundreds of thousands answer it, and for two days it looks as if the country might follow. ?][? if e21_ma_gain < 120 : In the Ruhr and in Berlin a minority comes out. Most workers read the call in the papers and go to work. ?] [? if e21_ma_strikes > 0 : Strike committees take over in [+ e21_ma_struck_names +]. ?][? if e21_ma_rift >= 2 : At several works our pickets try to keep the morning shift out with clubs, and the shift fights back. ?]

@regional
subtitle: Fight where we are strong and nowhere else. The Left says we are leaving Mansfeld to die alone.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_ma_out += 30;
Q.e21_spread_to = RG.spreadStrike('halle') ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e21_spread_to) { Q.e21_ma_out += 25; }
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

The Zentrale keeps the strike to the province of Saxony and its neighbours. No district is ordered into a fight it cannot win. [? if e21_spread_to = 1 : The strike crosses into the next district by itself. ?]

@appeal
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Works best if they believe we meant the Open Letter.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any appeal to the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
var gain = (Q.open_letter == 1) ? 90 : 40;
Q.e21_ma_gain = Math.round(gain * Math.max(0.3, 1 - 0.15 * Q.e21_ma_rift));
Q.e21_ma_out += Q.e21_ma_gain;
Q.spd_relation += 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Out on strike: about ' + Math.round(Q.e21_ma_out / 10) * 10 + ',000 of the ' + Q.e21_ma_need + ',000 it takes';
Q.crisis_line_2 = ['Leuna: occupied by its workers', 'Leuna: held against the police', 'Leuna: stormed on 29 March', 'Leuna: given up without a fight'][Q.e21_leuna];
Q.crisis_line_3 = (Q.e21_ma_rift >= 5) ? 'At the gates: the other workers have turned on us' : ((Q.e21_ma_rift >= 3) ? 'At the gates: worker against worker' : (Q.e21_ma_rift ? 'At the gates: some fights with the men at work' : 'At the gates: no fights yet'));
!}

Our appeal goes to every SPD and USPD branch in Central Germany: defend the district together against Hörsing's police. [? if e21_ma_gain >= 60 : Many local branches join the strike committees against their own leaders' orders. ?][? if e21_ma_gain < 60 : Here and there a branch comes over. Most wait to hear from their own leaders, who say no. ?]
